\[
\min_{0\le k\le T-1}
\dualnorm{\nabla f(x_k)}^{2}
\;\le\;
\frac{4L_h^{2}}{\mu\,\Gamma_T}\,
\bigl(f(x_0)-f^\star\bigr).
\tag{6$'$}
\]
Consequently, if $\eta_k\equiv\eta\le \tfrac{1}{2L}$, we obtain the
